{"id":"662773","name":"咸鱼蒸鸡蛋","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662773/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"咸鱼","amount":"144克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2只"}],"sub":[{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：咸鱼（已清洗）、鸡蛋、料酒。","img":"images/662773/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将已清洗的咸鱼用剪刀剪开放入盘中。","img":"images/662773/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"接着，加适量的料酒。","img":"images/662773/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"打入鸡蛋。","img":"images/662773/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"然后，放入炒锅里。","img":"images/662773/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上盖、开锅搁水蒸15分钟关火。","img":"images/662773/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"开盖取出。","img":"images/662773/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}